@startuml
skinparam stateFontSize 12
skinparam stateAttributeFontSize 10
skinparam roundCorner 8

title State Machine Diagram: Order Lifecycle (FoodExpress)

[*] --> Created : Items added to cart & checkout clicked

Created --> Payment_Pending : Customer initiates payment

Payment_Pending --> Confirmed : Payment verified & Restaurant accepts
Payment_Pending --> Cancelled : Payment declined / User timeout

Confirmed --> Preparing : Kitchen begins food preparation
Confirmed --> Cancelled : Restaurant rejects order (full refund initiated)

Preparing --> Out_for_Delivery : Food packed & handed to Delivery Partner

Out_for_Delivery --> Delivered : Customer receives package & confirms delivery
Out_for_Delivery --> Delivery_Failed : Customer unreachable / address incorrect

Delivered --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Delivery_Failed --> [*]

@enduml
